<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V VICTORIA 1ST DAY CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V VICTORIA 1ST DAY CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>WANGARATTA, Australia 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Victoria were bowled out for 354 at the close of play on the first day of a four-day match against West Indies on Thursday.</p>
<p>Score - Victoria 354 (Graeme Vimpani 133, Darren Berry 50; Nixon McLean five for 48).</p>
